option_map.fl:
  before Simplify (70 steps): returns [0: 15]
  after Simplify (4 steps): returns [0: 15]
  the check of kinds: passes before, passes after
  the check of static names: passes before, passes after
  calls outside code: 4 before, 0 after
  the same
  calls outside code once those of known code are inlined: 2
